  Colours for the experimental semantic viewer.

  Foreground and background are never set from here. These values are the colour of an underline, a
  dotted line, a wave or a box. They deliberately clash with the syntax colour of the thing they
  mark: an earlier version reused each kind's own syntax colour, so every mark was the same hue as
  the text above it and nothing was visible.
-->
